当<color=#ff6724>酿酒</color>状态叠加至<color=#158bdb>6</color>层时，获得<color=#ff6724>麦酒</color>状态。{Buff_V0112_6_1}{Buff_V0112_7_1}{Buff_V0112_7_2}

